WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.101
The young woman held Mandy’s arm tightly.

2
00:00:04.102 --> 00:00:09.883
"Miss Charlotte, you must not run away like that again," she said.

3
00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:15.875
"Excuse me," Mandy said, turning to look at the woman.

4
00:00:15.876 --> 00:00:19.175
"I’m not Charlotte."

5
00:00:19.176 --> 00:00:24.717
"Oh, you’re not," the woman said, letting go.

6
00:00:24.718 --> 00:00:31.268
She started to cry.

7
00:00:31.269 --> 00:00:36.096
"Please don’t cry," Mandy said kindly.

8
00:00:36.097 --> 00:00:38.608
"Can I help you?"

9
00:00:38.609 --> 00:00:41.246
The woman shook her head.

10
00:00:41.247 --> 00:00:47.355
She wore a long black skirt and a black shawl over a long-sleeved blouse.

11
00:00:47.356 --> 00:00:52.082
A bonnet was on her head.

12
00:00:52.083 --> 00:00:57.119
"I’m Florence, Miss Charlotte’s new nanny," she said.

13
00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:01.372
"We came here to watch the royal foot guards."

14
00:01:01.373 --> 00:01:05.803
"Look at that!" Vinnie interrupted them.

15
00:01:05.804 --> 00:01:11.870
Soldiers in red jackets and bearskin hats marched in front of the building.

16
00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:18.124
They were stepping very slowly, in perfect time with each other.

17
00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:23.945
Another group of soldiers marched just as slowly toward them.

18
00:01:23.946 --> 00:01:30.299
"It’s the changing of the guards," Vinnie cried excitedly.

19
00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:37.543
"We’re back in England, Mandy, and this must be Buckingham Palace!"

20
00:01:37.544 --> 00:01:44.717
"Quiet, Vinnie," whispered Mandy. "Florence is upset."

21
00:01:44.718 --> 00:01:49.441
Florence looked at Vinnie strangely, but continued.

22
00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:54.306
"Sometimes, Miss Charlotte likes to play tricks on me.

23
00:01:54.307 --> 00:01:57.512
She saw the crowd and ran off.

24
00:01:57.513 --> 00:02:04.044
I’ve been looking and looking . . . ," cried Florence.

25
00:02:04.045 --> 00:02:10.966
She blew her nose into a handkerchief.

26
00:02:10.967 --> 00:02:14.821
"She was wearing a pink dress like you."

27
00:02:14.822 --> 00:02:17.595
The ceremony was over.

28
00:02:17.596 --> 00:02:24.973
Now, new guards stood in front of the palace, and the old guards were marching away.

29
00:02:24.974 --> 00:02:29.896
Florence wiped her eyes.

30
00:02:29.897 --> 00:02:32.204
"I must not give up.

31
00:02:32.205 --> 00:02:35.680
Miss Charlotte is probably close by."

32
00:02:35.681 --> 00:02:39.705
"We’ll help you find her," said Mandy.

33
00:02:39.706 --> 00:02:42.950
"We will?" said Vinnie.

34
00:02:42.951 --> 00:02:50.333
"By the way, I’m Mandy, and this is my brother Vinnie," said Mandy.

35
00:02:50.334 --> 00:02:53.396
"Oh, thank you, Miss Mandy.

36
00:02:53.397 --> 00:02:57.927
But where is your nanny?" asked Florence.

37
00:02:57.928 --> 00:03:00.398
Mandy looked around.

38
00:03:00.399 --> 00:03:04.727
She and Vinnie were dressed very nicely.

39
00:03:04.728 --> 00:03:08.613
Some other children were dressed nicely too.

40
00:03:08.614 --> 00:03:12.954
They all walked with young women dressed like Florence.

41
00:03:12.955 --> 00:03:17.086
"We’re just visiting," Mandy said quickly.

42
00:03:17.087 --> 00:03:21.479
"Is your family new to London?" she asked.

43
00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:24.689
The children looked at each other.

44
00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:29.190
They remembered their earlier photo trip to London.

45
00:03:29.191 --> 00:03:34.267
"It’s only our second visit," Vinnie said truthfully.

46
00:03:34.268 --> 00:03:36.751
"We don’t live here."

47
00:03:36.752 --> 00:03:41.751
"Well, I’m glad you’re here," said Florence.

48
00:03:41.752 --> 00:03:45.348
"I would appreciate your help, thank you."

49
00:03:45.349 --> 00:03:49.290
The children followed Florence down the street.

50
00:03:49.291 --> 00:03:54.322
"Where do you think Charlotte would go?" asked Mandy.

51
00:03:54.323 --> 00:03:57.420
Florence thought for a moment.

52
00:03:57.421 --> 00:04:03.537
"Miss Charlotte has always wanted to see the Crystal Palace," she said.

53
00:04:03.538 --> 00:04:06.836
"That’s where the Great Exhibition is."

54
00:04:06.837 --> 00:04:10.544
"That sounds interesting," said Mandy.

55
00:04:10.545 --> 00:04:14.095
"What kind of exhibition is it?"

56
00:04:14.096 --> 00:04:17.780
Florence smiled at her.

57
00:04:17.781 --> 00:04:22.413
"Let’s start looking for Miss Charlotte there," she said.

58
00:04:22.414 --> 00:04:24.476
"It’s not far."

59
00:04:24.477 --> 00:04:34.054
The children followed Florence, who headed quickly down the street.

